  "captions": [
    {
      "row": "N1",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 6.694,
      "text": "I found a new coding-agent app."
    },
    {
      "row": "N2",
      "start": 7.794,
      "end": 10.127,
      "text": "Another one? What does this one do?"
    },
    {
      "row": "N3",
      "start": 11.227,
      "end": 16.753,
      "text": "It runs all of us. Side by side. On one plan."
    },
    {
      "row": "N4",
      "start": 17.853,
      "end": 19.478,
      "text": "Huh. What's it called?"
    },
    {
      "row": "N5",
      "start": 20.578,
      "end": 22.157,
      "text": "…That's the problem."
    },
    {
      "row": "S2",
      "start": 23.257,
      "end": 26.358,
      "text": "Hmm… Tah? The P's silent, right?"
    },
    {
      "row": "O1",
      "start": 27.458,
      "end": 30.012,
      "text": "Has to be. Like pterodactyl."
    },
    {
      "row": "O3",
      "start": 30.512,
      "end": 33.298,
      "text": "Honestly? It sounds… old."
    },
    {
      "row": "O4",
      "start": 45.398,
      "end": 46.591,
      "text": "Old."
    },
    {
      "row": "D1",
      "start": 48.041,
      "end": 52.612,
      "text": "I made the world by speaking its name. Say mine properly."
    },
    {
      "row": "D2",
      "start": 53.712,
      "end": 58.31,
      "text": "Respectfully… why does the god of builders care about coding agents?"
    },
    {
      "row": "D3",
      "start": 59.41,
      "end": 67.675,
      "text": "Look around. Many crews. One plan. Nothing goes up until it's checked."
    },
    {
      "row": "D5",
      "start": 68.175,
      "end": 71.796,
      "text": "Same idea. Now it runs on your desktop."
    },
    {
      "row": "D6",
      "start": 91.175,
      "end": 94.101,
      "text": "…okay. That's actually cool."
    }
  ]
